<title>USA: Iowa Community College rated A1 by Moody's.</title>
<headline>Iowa Community College rated A1 by Moody's.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, Oct 18 - Moody's Investors Service - Rating Announcement As of 10/17/96.</p>
<p>Issuer		: Iowa Western Comm. College</p>
<p>State		 : IA</p>
<p>Rating		: A1</p>
<p>Sale Amount	 : 3,000,000</p>
<p>Expected Sale Date: 10/21/96</p>
</text>
